Supplemental notices for the PaddleOCR browser worker

The scanner bundles @paddleocr/paddleocr-js 0.4.2 from its main ESM entry,
onnxruntime-web/common 1.31.1 from the WASM entry, and
@techstark/opencv-js 4.10.0-release.1 inside its own worker. These packages are
build inputs; their installed JavaScript dependency notices are collected in
dist/assets/licenses. The separately prebuilt PaddleOCR worker is not shipped:
its ORT 1.24.3 dependency graph and CDN defaults do not describe this build.

